            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Loadway 1.0.1</h2><ul><li>Move the quick bar with its dotted handle; the position is remembered.</li><li>Saved video quality limit, audio bitrate and destination for quick downloads.</li><li>Optional encrypted queue restoration after quitting, with manual resume.</li><li>Optional completion notifications with Open file and Show in Finder.</li><li>Clearer errors and recovery actions.</li><li>Updated download engine, FFmpeg and Sparkle.</li><li>Settings now immediately follows your selected language.</li></ul><p>Queue restoration and notifications are off by default. Some sources require a fresh link to resume. Partial media remains in the selected folder.</p>
]]></description>
